{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-turn-rewind#card-zh","repo":"Anionex/dsh-turn-rewind","commit":"737d716c5f693f96eb2adc3e9a79f4e55cda8735","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Turn Rewind（DSH Web 插件）：让用户从某条消息之前恢复会话和项目文件。它在对话消息操作区加入回退按钮，通过 Change Ledger 保存工作区恢复点，并提供文件差异预览与三种回退方式：同时恢复文件并重启会话、只恢复文件、或只回退消息。它还会在新一轮 Agent 处理前捕获检查点，并提供设置页管理保留数量和存储空间。适合需要撤销后续工作、从旧请求重新开始的 DSH Web 用户；不需要额外 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:874-895","src/client/index.tsx:999-1180","src/engine.ts:269-394","src/client/index.tsx:1301-1380"]}
{"unit_id":"Anionex__dsh-turn-rewind#card-en","repo":"Anionex/dsh-turn-rewind","commit":"737d716c5f693f96eb2adc3e9a79f4e55cda8735","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Turn Rewind (a DSH Web plugin) lets users restore a conversation and project files to the point before a selected message. It adds a rewind action to conversation messages and uses the Change Ledger to keep workspace restore points, preview file differences, and offer three modes: restore files and restart the conversation, restore files only, or rewind messages only. It also captures checkpoints before an Agent begins a turn and provides a settings page for retention and storage management. It suits DSH Web users who need to undo later work or restart from an earlier request; no API key or external account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:874-895","src/client/index.tsx:999-1180","src/engine.ts:269-394","src/client/index.tsx:1301-1380"]}
